      "content": "i checked the sheet name and it definitely says Recon_Report exactly. i also tried running it in a new workbook and it still happens. i'm not sure what you mean by the workbook not being set correctly? it's the same file where the code is. what else could be causing that 1004 error? it seems like a really basic piece of code so i'm confused.",
